      },
      "message": "fix(ui): show the machine overview as a two-column property grid\n\nThe Machine page and the machine editor header printed\nMachine::summary() as one run-on sentence with bare `?` for unknown\nvalues. Add Machine::rows(unit), label/value rows (Kind, Machine,\nSpindle, Axes with each stroke, Tool changer, Coolant, Workspace;\n\"not stated\" for unknowns, lengths in the document unit), and draw them\nas a wrapping egui Grid on both. The page adds a Source row.\nsummary() is unchanged for the setup sheet and boundary_draft.\n\nFixes #745\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
